  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8201.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the following:\n\n(a) Standards for local law enforcement to determine whether a condition exists to notify the division of state police to activate a blue alert;\n\n(b) Procedures for the activation of the blue alert system; and\n\n(c) Procedures for providing relevant information to the public through an existing system of dynamic message signs located across the state when necessary.\n\nSource. #13298, eff 11-30-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8200.html"
}
